OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced for 'terrifying'
OL,4,Ariverside attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been given a hospital order
OL,7,Fafter carrying out a "terrifying"
OL,8,Fattack on a woman along a riverside
OL,9,Fpath in Derby.
OL,11,FPolice said James Daniels grabbed and
OL,12,Fthreatened the 23-year-old victim with
OL,13,Fa knife while she was walking along the
OL,14,Fpath off Riverside Road, Pride Park, at
OL,15,F08:40 GMT on 17 November.
OL,17,FThe woman escaped with minor injuries
OL,18,Fafter a struggle, and the 19-year-old
OL,19,Ffled the scene before being arrested
OL,20,Fthe following day, the force added.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
