OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced for 'terrifying'
OL,4,Ariverside attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FDaniels, of Broomhill Avenue in
OL,7,FIlkeston, pleaded guilty to assault by
OL,8,Fbeating, possession of a knife/sharp
OL,9,Fpointed article in a public place,
OL,10,Fthreatening a person with a
OL,11,Fblade/sharply pointed article in a
OL,12,Fpublic place and false imprisonment.
